{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121105132551-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121140045\"/><p>受傷學童被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。</p><p>今日(21日)早上10時19分，葵涌安捷街一學校職員報案，指校內正進行工程，期間有石屎由高處墮下，有學童被濺傷。救護車接報到場將5名受輕傷學童送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理，人員經調查後，案列「意外受傷」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T06:14:56.997300+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T02:51:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:57:18.536471+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:08:30.663339+00:00","content_hash":"1b650d8df062af80f0a78f1b8cc328dae8d59953ef9b6ec52aab84eaccac37fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}